$ chap manual --profile docs
exit: 0
--- request
GET /v0/catalog?profile=docs
auth: run
--- stdout
manual: project acme-shop, profile docs, policy baseline-2026.10.1
health [routine] Read the pilot's readiness status.
  chap health
logs [routine] Read recent log lines from a fixed source.
  chap logs <web|worker|db|tunnel> [--lines <n>]
pr.open [routine] Open a pull request from the run's branch.
  chap pr open --title <t> [--branch <b>] [--base <b>] [--body <b>] [--draft]
pr.update [routine] Update a PR title or body, or update its branch.
  chap pr update <n> --expected-head <sha> [--title <t>] [--body <b>]
--- stderr
